{
  "key": 11955,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0493_T07PC0101_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "That Pokégear you have--\n",
        "it’s way too cool!\r",
        "Is that the...latest model?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0493_T07PC0101_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika is a master of Grass-type\n",
        "Pokémon.\r",
        "She’ll make you pay if you don’t\n",
        "watch yourself."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0493_T07PC0101_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "The Game Corner in this city used\n",
        "to be run by Team Rocket...\r",
        "But when Team Rocket was removed,\n",
        "this rich, game-loving man renovated\f",
        "the Game Corner for the fun of it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0493_T07PC0101_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Yo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "It’s been a while!\r",
        "Since we’re both here and there’s\n",
        "no rush, fancy a battle? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0493_T07PC0101_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Really? I wasn’t expecting you\n",
        "to turn down a challenge.\r",
        "Oh well, I’m here all day.\n",
        "Tell me if you want to fight!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0493_T07PC0101_00005",
      "en_US": "Awesome! Here I come, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0493_T07PC0101_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Amazing! Your skills haven’t dulled\n",
        "a bit since challenging Suicune!\r",
        "Don’t be afraid to tell me\n",
        "if you want a rematch, though!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0493_T07PC0101_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, incredible! That’s {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0} behind\n",
        "you, isn’t it?\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, your skills never cease\n",
        "to amaze me!\r",
        "Speaking about amazing...\r",
        "How about a battle to\n",
        " show you how amazing\f",
        "I can be, too? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0493_T07PC0101_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "That flowing mane...\n",
        "That graceful pose...\r",
        "Only such beauty could belong to\n",
        "Suicune! Thank you for allowing me to\f",
        "see it, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r",
        "Although I don’t need to prove\n",
        "anything to Suicune anymore...\r",
        "Would you be up\n",
        "for a friendly battle? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
